#. Tag: title
#: apiDatastructure.docbook:2
#, no-c-format
msgid "Scripting API for every Data Structure"
msgstr "Skriptiranje API-ja za svaku strukturu podataka."

#. Tag: title
#: apiDatastructure.docbook:4
#, no-c-format
msgid "Abstract Data Structure Object"
msgstr "Objekat apstraktne strukture podataka"

#. Tag: para
#: apiDatastructure.docbook:5
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The abstract data structure defines a set of data elements and possible "
"connections between them, this is the prototype for every other data "
"structure. Data structures are identified by their names. Assuming you "
"created a data structure with name <literal>testgraph</literal>, then you "
"can access the data structure simply by writing this identifier. For "
"example, to get an array with all data elements in the given data structure, "
"you can write <literal>testgraph.list_nodes();</literal> in the script."
msgstr ""
"Apstraktna struktura podataka definira set podataka i mogućih konekcija među "
"njima, ovo je prototip za svaku drugu strukturu podataka. Strukture podataka "
"su identifikovane po imenima. Pretpostavimo da ste kreirali strukturu "
"podataka imena <literal>testgraph</literal>, zatim možete pristupiti "
"strukturi podataka jednostavno ako napišete njen identifikator. Na primjer "
"da dobijete niz sa svim elementima date strukture podataka, možete napisati "
"<literal>testgraph.list_nodes();</literal> unutar skripte."

#. Tag: title
#: apiDatastructure.docbook:13 apiDatastructure.docbook:32
#: apiDatastructure.docbook:79
#, no-c-format
msgid "Properties"
msgstr "Osobine"

#. Tag: para
#: apiDatastructure.docbook:16
#, no-c-format
msgid "<emphasis>name</emphasis> :"
msgstr "<emphasis>ime</emphasis> :"

#. Tag: para
#: apiDatastructure.docbook:19
#, no-c-format
msgid "The unique name of this data structure."
msgstr "Jedinstveno ime ove strukture podataka."

#. Tag: title
#: apiDatastructure.docbook:26
#, no-c-format
msgid "Abstract Data"
msgstr "Apstraktni podaci"

#. Tag: para
#: apiDatastructure.docbook:27
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"An abstract data element is a unit of information that belongs to an "
"abstract data structure and possibly is connected to other data elements by "
"pointers."
msgstr ""
"Apstraktni podatak je dio informacije koja pripada apstraktnoj strukturi "
"podataka i može biti povezan sa drugim elementima podataka preko pokazivača."

#. Tag: para
#: apiDatastructure.docbook:35 apiDatastructure.docbook:82
#, no-c-format
msgid "<emphasis>width</emphasis> :"
msgstr "<emphasis>width</emphasis> :"

#. Tag: para
#: apiDatastructure.docbook:38
#, no-c-format
msgid "The size of this data element."
msgstr "Veličina elementa podataka."

#. Tag: para
#: apiDatastructure.docbook:42
#, no-c-format
msgid "<emphasis>x</emphasis> :"
msgstr "<emphasis>x</emphasis> :"

#. Tag: para
#: apiDatastructure.docbook:45
#, no-c-format
msgid "The x-coordinate of this data element."
msgstr "X koordinata ovog elementa podataka."

#. Tag: para
#: apiDatastructure.docbook:49
#, no-c-format
msgid "<emphasis>y</emphasis> :"
msgstr "<emphasis>y</emphasis> :"

#. Tag: para
#: apiDatastructure.docbook:52
#, no-c-format
msgid "The y-coordinate of this data element."
msgstr "Y koordinata ovog elementa podataka."

#. Tag: para
#: apiDatastructure.docbook:56
#, no-c-format
msgid "<emphasis>id</emphasis> :"
msgstr "<emphasis>id</emphasis> :"

#. Tag: para
#: apiDatastructure.docbook:59
#, no-c-format
msgid "The unique identifier of this data element."
msgstr "Jedinstveni identifikator ovog elementa podataka."

#. Tag: para
#: apiDatastructure.docbook:63 apiDatastructure.docbook:110
#, no-c-format
msgid "<emphasis>color</emphasis> :"
msgstr "<emphasis>color</emphasis> :"

#. Tag: para
#: apiDatastructure.docbook:66
#, no-c-format
msgid "The color of this data element stated as hexadecimal value."
msgstr "Boja ovog elementa podataka kao heksadekadna vrijednost."

#. Tag: title
#: apiDatastructure.docbook:74
#, no-c-format
msgid "Abstract Pointer"
msgstr "Apstraktni pokazivač"

#. Tag: para
#: apiDatastructure.docbook:75
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A pointer connects two data elements and can itself hold information by its "
"properties."
msgstr ""
"Pokazivač spaja dva elementa podataka i može zadržati informacije po svojim "
"osobinama."

#. Tag: para
#: apiDatastructure.docbook:85
#, no-c-format
msgid "The width of the connection."
msgstr "Širina veze."

#. Tag: para
#: apiDatastructure.docbook:89
#, no-c-format
msgid "<emphasis>directed</emphasis> :"
msgstr "<emphasis>directed</emphasis> :"

#. Tag: para
#: apiDatastructure.docbook:92
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If true, the connection is directed. Otherwise is connection is undirected."
msgstr "Ako je tačno, veza je usmjerena. Inače, veza nije usmjerena."

#. Tag: para
#: apiDatastructure.docbook:96
#, no-c-format
msgid "<emphasis>from</emphasis> :"
msgstr "<emphasis>from</emphasis> :"

#. Tag: para
#: apiDatastructure.docbook:99
#, no-c-format
msgid "Start of the connection."
msgstr "Početak veze."

#. Tag: para
#: apiDatastructure.docbook:103
#, no-c-format
msgid "<emphasis>to</emphasis> :"
msgstr "<emphasis>to</emphasis> :"

